  unitName: Roaring Crash Balgran
  unitId: 40586
  unitNumber: 962
  description: After meeting his sister, the Oracle Maiden, once again, he was resolved
    to accompany her and her comrades in their journey, though he never mentioned
    a word about his past. And thus, once the battle with the gods began, he devoted
    himself to protecting the Oracle Maiden. Seeing his gallant figure filled everyone
    with relief, allowing them to go after the gods without feeling any anxiety.
    However, Balgran suffered a terrible injury at the hands of a powerful god whilst
    in the heat of battle which left him in a grievous condition. It is said that
    seeing from his broken helmet that the Maiden was still safe, he began to fight
    back against the gods all over again.
  summonDesc: Yes, I understand...<br>But my precious childhood memories...<br>I
    was truly happy back then...
  fusionDesc: Thank you for everything.<br>I can feel your gentleness and warmth<br>through
    this power.
  evoDesc: My family bonds made me stronger.<br>And my will to protect someone<br>precious
    to me too.
  element: 4
  rarity: 6
